{"title":"Career roadmap · FinTech Associate","role":"FinTech Associate","summary":"Career alignment: A FinTech Associate is an early-career professional who supports technology-enabled financial products and operations across payments, digital banking, lending, wealth-tech, InsurTech, financial data, compliance technology and financial platforms.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The role sits at the intersection of business + finance + technology + data + operations. It is therefore well aligned with a BBA FinTech degree, especially when combined with practical exposure to APIs, SQL, analytics, payment systems, financial products and regulatory concepts."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Role","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"FinTech Associate"},{"text":"Product/operations/analytics support"}],[{"text":"1–3 years"},{"text":"FinTech Analyst / Product Operations Analyst"},{"text":"Processes, data, product performance"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"FinTech Product Analyst / Business Analyst / Risk Analyst"},{"text":"Product, analytics or risk specialisation"}],[{"text":"4–7 years"},{"text":"Senior Product Analyst / Product Operations Manager"},{"text":"Product ownership and optimisation"}],[{"text":"6–10 years"},{"text":"FinTech Product Manager / Risk Manager / Operations Manager"},{"text":"Functional leadership"}],[{"text":"10+ years"},{"text":"Senior Product Leader / FinTech Strategy Head / Business Head"},{"text":"Strategy and business growth"}],[{"text":"Entrepreneurial"},{"text":"FinTech Founder / Product Entrepreneur"},{"text":"Building financial technology products"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During BBA FinTech","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Business, Finance & Technology Foundations"},{"type":"h","text":"Core business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"tex