ch startup"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Payment companies"},{"text":"Banking technology companies"},{"text":"NBFCs"},{"text":"FinTech startups"},{"text":"Digital banking teams"},{"text":"Payment operations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3"},{"type":"p","text":"Target specialised internships:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FinTech Product Analyst"},{"text":"Business Analyst"},{"text":"Risk Analyst"},{"text":"Fraud Analyst"},{"text":"Payments Analyst"},{"text":"Data Analyst"},{"text":"Product Operations"},{"text":"Credit Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FinTech product"},{"text":"Digital banking"},{"text":"Payment platforms"},{"text":"Lending technology"},{"text":"WealthTech"},{"text":"InsurTech"},{"text":"RegTech"},{"text":"Financial analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best internship progression:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Finance Operations","FinTech Operations","Analytics/Product","FinTech Product or Risk"]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Certifications should support practical capability rather than replace it."},{"type":"h","text":"Finance"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial markets"},{"text":"Banking"},{"text":"Payments"},{"text":"Credit"},{"text":"Risk management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"FinTech"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital payments"},{"text":"Blockchain fundamentals"},{"text":"Open banking"},{"text":"Digital banking"},{"text":"Financial APIs"},{"text":"Embedded finance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Statistics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Product"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Agile/Scrum"},{"text":"Product management"},{"text":"Business analysis"},{"text":"Product analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Risk"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AML"},{"text":"KYC"},{"text":"Fraud prevention"},{"text":"Financial crime"},{"text":"Risk analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Professional qualifications such as CFA, FRM or specialised banking/financial-market certifications can be considered later depending on the student's chosen direction."}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A BBA FinTech graduate should not search only for the title “FinTech Associate.”"},{"type":"h","text":"Entry-level roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FinTech Associate"},{"text":"FinTech Operations Associate"},{"text":"FinTech Analyst"},{"text":"Product Operations Associate"},{"text":"Business Analyst"},{"text":"Product Analyst"},{"text":"Payments Associate"},{"text":"Payments Operations Analyst"},{"text":"Reconciliation Analyst"},{"text":"Digital Banking Associate"},{"text":"Risk Operations Associate"},{"text":"Fraud Operations Analyst"},{"text":"KYC Analyst"},{"text":"AML Analyst"},{"text":"Credit Operations Associate"},{"text":"Financial Data Analyst"},{"text":"Junior Business Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"With stronger technical skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FinTech Data Analyst"},{"text":"Product Data Analyst"},{"text":"Risk Analyst"},{"text":"Fraud Analytics Analyst"},{"text":"Payments Analyst"},{"text":"Business Intelligence Analyst"},{"text":"Junior Product Manager"}]},{"type":"h","text":"What Employers May Test"},{"type":"h","text":"Finance"},{"type":"note","label":"Question","text":"What is the difference between revenue, profit and cash flow?"},{"type":"h","text":"Payments"},{"type":"note","label":"Question","text":"A customer's account is debited but the merchant has not received confirmation. How would you investigate it?"},{"type":"h","text":"Reconciliation"},{"type":"p","text":"Compare:"},{"type":"h","text":"Internal transaction records ↔ Payment-provider records ↔ Bank/settlement records"},{"type":"p","text":"Identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Missing transactions"},{"text":"Duplicates"},{"text":"Amount mismatches"},{"text":"Failed transactions"},{"text":"Refund mismatches"},{"text":"Timing differences"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Typical tests:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer transaction analysis"},{"text":"Monthly transaction volume"},{"text":"Top merchants"},{"text":"Failed transactions"},{"text":"Repeat customers"},{"text":"Fraud-like transaction patterns"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"They may ask the candidate to identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Payment failure rate"},{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"Customer retention"},{"text":"Transaction growth"},{"text":"Fraud rate"},{"text":"Average transaction value"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Product"},{"type":"note","label":"Question","text":"How would you improve a mobile payment application?"},{"type":"p","text":"Expected thinking:"},{"type":"flow","items":["User problem","data","root cause","solution","MVP","metric","experiment","iteration"]},{"type":"h","text":"Case study"},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"“Payment failures increased by 15%. What would you investigate?”"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong candidate considers:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Payment method"},{"text":"Bank/network"},{"text":"Merchant"},{"text":"Device"},{"text":"Geography"},{"text":"Time"},{"text":"API errors"},{"text":"Transaction amount"},{"text":"Customer segment"},{"text":"Provider dependency"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"MBA Finance"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FinTech strategy"},{"text":"Financial services"},{"text":"Banking"},{"text":"Investment"},{"text":"Corporate finance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MBA FinTech"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital banking"},{"text":"FinTech product management"},{"text":"Financial technology strategy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MBA Business Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FinTech analytics"},{"text":"Product analytics"},{"text":"Risk analytics"},{"text":"Data-driven finance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MBA Product Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FinTech Product Manager"},{"text":"Digital Product Manager"},{"text":"Product Strategy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MSc Finance / Financial Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for students seeking deeper quantitative/technical specialisation."},{"type":"h","text":"Professional pathways"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on direction:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CFA → investment/financial analysis"},{"text":"FRM → risk"},{"text":"Relevant NISM qualifications → Indian securities/financial-market roles"},{"text":"Professional banking/AML qualifications → banking/compliance"},{"text":"Data/analytics qualifications → FinTech analytics"}]}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant postgraduate programmes include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Master's in Financial Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"For:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"Digital banking"},{"text":"Payments"},{"text":"Financial innovation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Master's in Business Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"For:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FinTech analytics"},{"text":"Product analytics"},{"text":"Risk analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Master's in Finance"},{"type":"p","text":"For:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Investment"},{"text":"Banking"},{"text":"Financial analysis"},{"text":"Wealth management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Master's in Financial Engineering / Quantitative Finance"},{"type":"p","text":"For mathematically stronger students targeting:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Quantitative finance"},{"text":"Algorithmic trading"},{"text":"Risk modelling"},{"text":"Financial modelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Master's in Information Systems"},{"type":"p","text":"For:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial technology systems"},{"text":"Enterprise technology"},{"text":"Digital transformation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The most suitable destination depends on the target career, mathematics background, budget, work-permit rules and university-specific eligibility."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Route 1 — FinTech Product"},{"type":"flow","items":["FinTech Associate","Product Analyst","Senior Product Analyst","Associate Product Manager","Product Manager","Senior PM","Head of Product"]},{"type":"h","text":"Route 2 — Payments"},{"type":"flow","items":["FinTech Associate","Payments Analyst","Senior Payments Analyst","Payments Product/Operations Manager","Head of Payments"]},{"type":"h","text":"Route 3 — Risk"},{"type":"flow","items":["FinTech Associate","Risk Analyst","Senior Risk Analyst","Risk Manager","Head of Risk"]},{"type":"h","text":"Route 4 — Data"},{"type":"flow","items":["FinTech Associate","Data Analyst","Senior Data Analyst","Analytics Manager","Head of Analytics"]},{"type":"h","text":"Route 5 — Fraud"},{"type":"flow","items":["FinTech Associate","Fraud Analyst","Senior Fraud Analyst","Fraud/Risk Manager","Fraud Intelligence Head"]},{"type":"h","text":"Route 6 — Business"},{"type":"flow","items":["FinTech Associate","Business Analyst","Senior BA","Product/Strategy Manager","FinTech Strategy Head"]},{"type":"h","text":"2040–2046 Career Evolution"},{"type":"p","text":"FinTech careers are likely to become increasingly AI-native."},{"type":"h","text":"1. AI Financial Operations"},{"type":"p","text":"Routine reconciliation, transaction investigation and reporting will become increasingly automated."},{"type":"p","text":"The human role shifts toward:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Exception handling"},{"text":"Decision-making"},{"text":"Controls"},{"text":"AI supervision"},{"text":"Escalation management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. AI Fraud Intelligence"},{"type":"p","text":"Fraud systems will increasingly combine:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Real-time transaction data"},{"text":"Behavioural analytics"},{"text":"Graph analytics"},{"text":"Machine learning"},{"text":"Device intelligence"},{"text":"Identity signals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible future role:"},{"type":"h","text":"AI Fraud Intelligence Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"3. Autonomous FinTech Products"},{"type":"p","text":"AI agents may increasingly support:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer onboarding"},{"text":"Financial analysis"},{"text":"Product recommendations"},{"text":"Credit workflows"},{"text":"Claims processing"},{"text":"Compliance monitoring"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Human professionals will increasingly manage AI-driven financial workflows rather than manually execute every workflow."},{"type":"h","text":"4. Embedded Finance"},{"type":"p","text":"Financial services will increasingly appear inside:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Mobility"},{"text":"Healthcare"},{"text":"Education"},{"text":"SaaS"},{"text":"Social platforms"},{"text":"Enterprise software"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This creates demand for professionals who understand both financial products and technology platforms."},{"type":"h","text":"5. RegTech & AI Governance"},{"type":"p","text":"Growing AI usage will create demand for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI risk"},{"text":"Model governance"},{"text":"Financial compliance"},{"text":"Explainability"},{"text":"Data governance"},{"text":"Responsible AI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Core"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA FinTech","Finance","Banking","Payments","Business Operations"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"flow","it